15 * * * * command
Runs at minute 15 of every hour.

0 5 * * * command
Runs daily at 5 AM.

0 8 15 * * command
Runs at 8:00 AM on the 15th of every month.

0 8 * 12 * command
Runs at 8:00 AM every day in December.

0 9 * * 1 command
Runs every Monday at 9 AM.

Special Characters

1. Asterisk (*)
Means "every value".

