Monthly
@monthly command

i.e.. 12:00AM 1st of every month

Equivalent:
0 0 1 * *

Weekly
@weekly command

i.e.. 12:00AM every week Sunday

Equivalent:
0 0 * * 0

Daily
@daily command

i.e.. 12:00AM daily

Equivalent:
0 0 * * *

Hourly
@hourly command

Equivalent:
0 * * * *

